LifeOS: personal use, share freely, no warranty.

You may use LifeOS for yourself and your family, copy it, and give copies to anyone, for free,
as long as this notice comes with every copy. You may change it for your own use.

LifeOS comes with no warranty of any kind. Keep backups of your notes. The author is not liable
for any loss or damage from using it.

Included and used third-party material:
- City list (apps/web/src/lib/cities-data.json): GeoNames, https://www.geonames.org, licensed
  under Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 (CC BY 4.0).
- Hadith library (src/fixtures/starter-vault/Resources/hadith-library): texts imported from the open-source
  Thaqalayn API (https://www.thaqalayn-api.net), which publishes them from thaqalayn.net. They are
  included verbatim with their book, reference and grading; their use follows those sources' terms.
- Prayer times: adhan-js (MIT). Search: SearXNG (AGPL-3.0), run from its official Docker image.
- The program's other open-source libraries are fetched when LifeOS is built; each keeps its own
  license (see src/package-lock.json for the list).
